(Chapter 25: Security) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0 g
56.6929133858267775 734.1734645669291695 Td
(This chapter explains GrainFlow's security architecture in practical terms for administrators responsible for) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0 g
56.6929133858267775 720.0002362204724022 Td
(the system.) Tj
ET
BT
/F2 14 Tf
16.0999999999999979 TL
0 g
56.6929133858267775 683.1498425196850803 Td
(Multi-Tenant Data Isolation) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0 g
56.6929133858267775 643.4648031496062686 Td
(GrainFlow is a multi-tenant system where multiple warehouses share the same database. Data isolation is) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0 g
56.6929133858267775 629.291574803149615 Td
(the most critical security property: Warehouse A must never see Warehouse B's customers, records, or) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0 g
56.6929133858267775 615.1183464566928478 Td
(payments.) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0 g
56.6929133858267775 586.7718897637794271 Td
(This isolation is enforced at the database level using Row Level Security \(RLS\).) Tj
ET
BT
/F2 11 Tf
12.6499999999999986 TL
0 g
56.6929133858267775 552.7561417322833677 Td
(How Row Level Security Works) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0 g
56.6929133858267775 522.9923622047243725 Td
(Every major table in the database \(storage_records, customers, payments, expenses, etc.\) has a) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0 g
56.6929133858267775 508.8191338582676622 Td
(warehouse_id column. Supabase RLS policies are attached to these tables that automatically filter queries) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0 g
56.6929133858267775 494.6459055118109518 Td
(based on the logged-in user's warehouse assignment.) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0 g
56.6929133858267775 466.2994488188975879 Td
(In simple terms:) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0 g
56.6929133858267775 437.952992125984224 Td
(  1. A user logs in and gets an auth session with their user ID.) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0 g
56.6929133858267775 418.1104724409448181 Td
(  2. When they query any table, the database checks: "Which warehouses is this user assigned to?") Tj
ET
BT
/F1 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0 g
56.6929133858267775 398.2679527559054691 Td
(  3. The database only returns rows where warehouse_id matches one of the user's assigned warehouses.) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0 g
56.6929133858267775 378.4254330708660632 Td
(  4. This filtering is invisible to the application code -- it happens inside PostgreSQL before results are) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0 g
56.6929133858267775 364.2522047244094097 Td
(returned.) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0 g
56.6929133858267775 335.9057480314959889 Td
(This means even if a bug in the application code forgets to add a WHERE warehouse_id = ... clause, the) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0 g
56.6929133858267775 321.7325196850392786 Td
(database will still enforce the filter. This is a defense-in-depth strategy.) Tj
ET
BT
/F2 11 Tf
12.6499999999999986 TL
0 g
56.6929133858267775 287.7167716535432191 Td
(What RLS Does NOT Do) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0 g
56.6929133858267775 257.952992125984224 Td
(  - RLS does not filter based on role \(owner vs. staff\). Role-based restrictions within a warehouse are handled) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0 g
56.6929133858267775 243.7797637795274568 Td
(at the application layer.) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0 g
56.6929133858267775 223.9372440944881646 Td
(  - RLS does not apply to database admin connections or service role keys. The Supabase service role key) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0 g
56.6929133858267775 209.7640157480313974 Td
(bypasses all RLS policies. Never expose this key to the client.) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0 g
56.6929133858267775 181.4175590551179766 Td
(  Warning: The SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY bypasses all RLS. It is used only in server-side code for) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0 g
56.6929133858267775 167.2443307086613231 Td
(admin operations \(cron jobs, webhooks\). It must never be exposed to the browser or included in) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0 g
56.6929133858267775 153.0711023622046696 Td
(NEXT_PUBLIC_ environment variables.) Tj
ET
BT
/F2 14 Tf
16.0999999999999979 TL
0 g
56.6929133858267775 116.220708661417234 Td
(Authentication) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 8 Tf
9.1999999999999993 TL
0 g
272.9177952755906063 19.8427559055116944 Td
(Page 73 of 80) Tj
